\pard\b\fs20 Faffnir 1\b0\par
\fs16\par
You are an assassin. Without a home. And without scruples. One day, in a smoky tavern, you hear about a legendary artifact. It is said to have belonged to Faffnir, the greatest assassin of all time, and it is kept in the treasure chamber of a Kanderian castle.\par
And so you set off...\par
